Likely related to {{och-l|聽|to hear; to listen|id=1}}, {{och-l|聲|sound}} ({{zh-ref|Boltz, 1994}}). If derived directly from {{och-l|聲|sound}}, it would literally mean “to be renowned; someone who is renowned” ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

