===Definitions===
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# [[sound]]; [[noise]]; [[voice]] {{zh-mw|c:把}}
#: {{zh-co|我 聽 到 尖叫 聲。|I heard someone scream.}}
#: {{zh-co|鈴聲 將 我 喚醒。|I was roused by the '''sound''' of a bell.}}
#: {{zh-co|遠處 傳來 火車 的 汽笛 聲。|The '''sound''' of a train's whistle came from a distance.}}
#: {{zh-co|槍炮 聲 使 群眾 驚慌失措。|The crowd panicked at the '''sound''' of the guns.}}
#: {{zh-co|電話 冇 聲|no '''sound''' on the phone|C}}
#* {{zh-x|我 聞 其 聲、不 見 其 身。|I heard his '''voice''', but did not see his person.|ref=Shijing}}
# {{lb|zh|literary}} [[music]]
#* {{zh-x|子 曰：「惡{wù} 紫 之 奪 朱 也，惡{wù} ^鄭 聲 之 亂 雅樂 也，惡{wù} 利口 之 覆 邦家 者。」|The Master said, "I hate the manner in which purple takes away the luster of vermilion. I hate the way in which the songs of Zheng confound the music of the Ya. I hate those who with their sharp mouths overthrow kingdoms and families."|ref=Analects}}
# {{lb|zh|literary}} [[words]]; [[speech]]
#* {{zh-x|臣 聞 古 之 君子，交絕 不 出 惡聲。||ref=Shiji}}
# {{lb|zh|literary}} to [[make]] a [[sound]]; to [[sound]]
#: {{zh-co|不聲不響|quiet; silent}}
#* {{zh-x|風 興{xīng} 雲 蒸，事 無 不 應{yìng}；雷 聲 雨 降，並 應{yìng} 無窮。||ref=Huainanzi}}
# [[reputation]]
#: {{zh-x|聲望|popularity}}
#: {{zh-x|名聲|reputation}}
#: {{zh-x|聲譽|reputation}}
# [[news]]; [[messages]]
# [[tone]]
#: {{zh-x|四聲|the four tones of Classical and Modern Chinese}}
# to [[declare]]; to [[state]]
#: {{zh-co|聲明|declaration; statement}}
#: {{zh-co|聲稱|to claim, to declare}}
#: {{zh-co|聲討|to denounce}}
# {{zh-classifier|sounds}}
#: {{zh-co|一 聲 槍響|the '''sound''' of a gunshot}}
#: {{zh-co|說 聲 「我.愛.你」|say "I love you"}}
#: {{zh-x|講 聲 「多謝」 都 冇|without saying even "thank you"|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Cantonese}} {{n-g|Suffix used to form adjectives with onomatopoeia.}}
#: {{zh-co|啦{laa4}啦{laa4-2}聲|quick|C}}
#: {{zh-co|𠽌{syut4}𠽌{syut4-2}聲|with a sucking sound|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Cantonese}} {{n-g|Suffix used after large numerals to express the magnitude of a number.}}
#: {{zh-co|億 億 聲|in the magnitudes of hundreds of millions|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Cantonese|chiefly in the negative}} to make a [[sound]]
#: {{zh-co|唔聲唔聲||C}}
#: {{zh-co|聲都唔聲||C}}
# {{lb|zh|Cantonese}} something that is [[said]] {{zh-mw|c:句|c:粒}}
#: {{zh-x|出聲\出 少 句 出聲\'''聲''' 當{dong3} 幫忙|shut up|lit=say one sentence less as a help|C}}
#: {{zh-co|單聲\單 句 單聲\'''聲'''|to inform someone|C}}
#: {{zh-x|粒 '''聲''' 唔 出|without saying anything|C}}
# {{lb|zh|Chinese phonetics}} [[initial]]

====Usage notes====
* {{s|Cantonese suffix used to form onomatopoeia}} This suffix is accompanied by a tone change in the reduplicated word, where the second occurrence is changed to the second tone (unless its original tone is the first or second tone), as seen in the examples above.

